{"id":1823827,"retrievedAt":"2026-11-12T19:06:22.273Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/9Dz2spt9yDoKEMpebX0pTyXUzkc.jpg","belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":4000,"genres":[{"id":18,"name":"Drama"},{"id":10751,"name":"Family"}],"homepage":"","id":1823827,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["AU"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Moon and Back","overview":"Harper, a recent high school graduate, who is beginning her new life at university, facing the pressures of a new start. This big change in her life causes her to distance herself from her mother, Janet. Ignoring Janet during a movie night, Janet is confused and upset by her daughter's behaviour and is unable to understand why Harper is pushing her away. The coddling from her mother and the looming anxiety of her future blurs Harper's emotions, causing her to run off to her room. Janet attempts to keep the peace, but with Harper ignoring her, the tension builds, leading to an explosive altercation. During this moment, Janet realises Harper's behaviour isn’t usual teenage rudeness, but something much deeper. They both realise that their anger is rooted in sadness and anxiety. As they talk, Harper learns that she should embrace this change, and even if it doesn't work out, her mother will always be there for her.","popularity":0,"poster_path":"/n724SBNl010IBnduHYqwHpuPrQ.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"AU","name":"Australia"}],"release_date":"2026-11-08","revenue":0,"runtime":7,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"English","iso_639_1":"en","name":"English"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"When a young woman starting university withdraws from her mother as her anxiety deepens, her silence begins to fracture their relationship, forcing her to open up before the damage becomes permanent.","title":"Moon and Back","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":6642642